  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$2 \\mathrm{H}^{+}+2 \\mathrm{e}^{-} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{H}_2(\\mathrm{~g})$\n$\\mathrm{E}=\\mathrm{E}^{\\circ}-0.059 \\log \\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{H}_2}}{\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]^2}\\right)$ (here $\\mathrm{E}$ is -ve when $\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{H}_2}>\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]^2$ )\n$=\\frac{-0.0591}{2} \\log _{10}\\left(\\frac{2}{1}\\right)=\\frac{-.0591}{2} \\times .3010=$ negative value",
